 the machine changed, and the refusal names the offending (Scope, WriteKey).]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>EVENT_CONFIG_SET_APPLIED</Text><Enum>2043</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ §8.3 audit trail for a set that WAS applied — an event, not an alarm.]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TEST_FAULT</Text><Enum>2901</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ ── Framework 2900–2909: framework self-test (never raised in production) ──]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_Severity</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §8.1]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BaseType>DINT</BaseType><EnumInfo><Text>LOW</Text><Enum>0</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>MED</Text><Enum>1</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>HIGH</Text><Enum>2</Enum></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_Category</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §8.8 (ST_Diagnostic.Category)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BaseType>DINT</BaseType><EnumInfo><Text>PROCESS</Text><Enum>0</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>SAFETY</Text><Enum>1</Enum></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>SYSTEM</Text><Enum>2</Enum></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_Diagnostic</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §8.8 — the full first-out reason record]]></Comment><BitSize>5568</BitSize><SubItem><Name>ReasonCode</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_Reason</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ named reason; ErrorID = TO_DWORD(ReasonCode)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>SourcePath</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ OPC UA browse path of the module/condition (Core §4.8)]]></Comment><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Description</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ localization key (from PermIntlk or