</Enum></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ConfigEntry</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §3.10.2 — one configuration value served through the request mailbox
