SubItem><SubItem><Name>ClassId</Name><Type>STRING(40)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.8d - computed by the PLC so a client greys and hides from data, never
 from its own copy of the policy. Readable = FALSE serves the entry WITHOUT
 its value: the editor can say something exists and why it is hidden.]]></Comment><BitSize>328</BitSize><BitOffs>11216</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ReadLevel</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_AccessLevel</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>11552</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>WriteLevel</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_AccessLevel</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>11584</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Readable</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>11616</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>UnitCode</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_EngUnit</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Appended (Core 0.14): the unit as a CODE the HMI translates, and the
