 (_M_TickChildren, so status stays live whether or not a command runs — Annex B),
 and adopts the first faulted child's diagnostic verbatim (_M_RollupFault).]]></Comment><BitSize>266496</BitSize><ExtendsType Namespace="Fraktal_Core">FB_ModuleBase</ExtendsType><SubItem><Name>_children</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_Module</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>16</Elements></ArrayInfo><BitSize>1024</BitSize><BitOffs>265408</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>OPC.UA.DA</Name><Value>0</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_nChild</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>266432</BitOffs></SubItem><Method><Name>M_AppendConfig</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.10.2 — own facets first, then every registered child, depth-first in
