 child's declared-wait reason (with the child's SourcePath) so this composite is
 held-and-explained rather than silently BUSY. No ERROR, no alarm: a hold rolls up
 as information, and clears itself when the child resumes.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Local><Name>i</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>__getModuleType</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_ModuleType</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Local><Name>ModuleType</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_ModuleType</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></Local><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>M_ApplyManual</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ §7.6.1 - own registration first, then every registered child in the same
