 chart links to. Unlike M_SequenceFault this carries severity/category and a
 link, so a step can adopt a child's fault verbatim or declare its own message.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Diag</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_Diagnostic</Type><BitSize>5568</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>LinkPath</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>M_SequenceRegister</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ §6.8 a chain announces itself at M_Attach so the owning Unit can run
