 through the ordinary typed handler and a revision mismatch refuses it.]]></Comment><BitSize>2016</BitSize><SubItem><Name>WriteKey</Name><Type>STRING(160)</Type><BitSize>1288</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Revision</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1312</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>ValueText</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>1344</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineImage</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §3.8e - the owner's published line data, whole. A mirror reads this one
 structure and applies it all or not at all; nothing is ever read field by field.]]></Comment><BitSize>65568</BitSize><SubItem><Name>LineId</Name><Type>STRING(40)</Type><BitSize>328</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Owner</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ owner module's canonical identity]]></Comment><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>328</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Revision</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ rises on every accepted change at the owner]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>992</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Count</Name><Type>INT</Type><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>1024</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Records</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineRecord</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>32</Elements></ArrayInfo><BitSize>64512</BitSize><BitOffs>1056</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_LineSource</Name><BitSize>64</BitSize><ExtendsType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000018}">PVOID</ExtendsType><Method><Name>M_Error</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ The last transport error, 0 when the last attempt succeeded.]]></Comment><ReturnType>DINT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>M_Poll</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Call every scan. TRUE on the scan a complete owner image was obtained.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Image</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core" ReferenceTo="true">ST_LineImage</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>InOut</Value></Property></Properties></Parameter></Method><Properties><Property><Name>TcPlcInterfaceType</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataParCfg</Name><BitSize>64</BitSize><SubItem><Name>SchemaVersion</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ §3.8: first member]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs><Default><Value>1</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name>StaleAfterMs</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: declared window for staying current (§3.8e(d))]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataParCmd</Name><BitSize>8</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Reserved</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ line data takes no command: physical four-structure contract]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineDataOutCmd</Name><BitSize>8</BitSize><SubItem><Name>Reserved</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ no command result]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_LineStatus</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §3.8e(d) - what a copy of line data says about itself.]]></Comment><BitSize>1184</BitSize><SubItem><Name>LineId</Name><Type>STRING(40)</Type><BitSize>328</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Role</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">E_LineRole</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>352</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Owner</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ identity of the copy this one came from]]></Comment><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>384</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Revision</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ revision held here]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1056</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>LastUpdate</Name><Type>DATE_AND_TIME</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: last successful update (§2.7 clock)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1088</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>TimeSynchronized</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ quality of LastUpdate]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1120</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>Stale</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ mirror: no successful update within the declared window]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>1128</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>SourceError</Name><Type>DINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ 0 ok; 1 wrong line; 2 not applicable whole; else source error]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>1152</BitOffs></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ShiftCalendar</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Core §8.5.2(a) - a line's shift calendar. Line data (§3.8e): edited once at the
 owner, mirrored whole. Compact on purpose - five registered values - so a line
 module keeps room for the project's own line data. A shift is named by its index
