s>318976</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_retractOutputTag</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>319624</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_extendedTimeoutKey</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>320272</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_retractedTimeoutKey</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>322320</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_bothSensorsKey</Name><Type>STRING(255)</Type><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>324368</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_bothSensorTags</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>326416</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>_bothSensorAddresses</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>327064</BitOffs></SubItem><Method><Name>CommitRecipe</Name></Method><Method><Name>WithdrawOutputs</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Functional stop used by an owning sequence on abort/interlock loss.
