 chain, including a repeated HOME/CHANGEOVER run that does not pass through
 another mode change. Resuming where an error stopped is the other legitimate
 choice; this station does not make it.]]></Comment><ReturnType>DINT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>Setup</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Name</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><BitSize>648</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>PressHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_CylinderHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>DoorHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_CylinderHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>SlideHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_CylinderHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>TwoHandHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_TwoHandHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>PowerHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_PowerGroupHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>PartPresentHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_DigitalInputHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>AirPressureHal</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Modules" ReferenceTo="true">ST_AirPressureHal</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Parameter><Name>Recipe</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">I_RecipeProvider</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize></Parameter><Local><Name>InitialModel</Name><Type Namespace="Fraktal_Core">ST_ModelId</Type><BitSize>7856</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>Ok</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>RequestLocalControl</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Application-only seam for ordinary hardwired Control On/Off buttons.
